netfosdl v0.1 - DOS FOSSIL Driver
GPLv3 real-mode FOSSIL for MS-DOS.
Drop-in for X00, BNU, ADF, NetFoss.
INT 14h, FSC-0015 r5 + FSC-0072.
Real 8250/16550 UART, X00 cmdline.
TSR with proper resident sizing.
Verified: AX=1954h in DOSBox-X.
Built with fpc264irc i8086 (huge).
Based on Dedrick Allen NetModem/32.
FPC264IRC crew - 2026 - 4free
